{
  "name": "11 Ops nightly backup + weekly scorecard",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 23 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every night 23:30 ET",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -120
      ],
      "notes": "After the 23:00 pre-market baseline job (workflow 01), so the night's writes are included in the backup rather than missed by half an hour."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/ops/backup",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "false"
            },
            {
              "name": "prune",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 900000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "POST /ops/backup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        -120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "One JSONL file per table into data/backups/<stamp>, plus a manifest with a SHA-256 per file and an index of the parquet cache. notify=false because a successful backup every night is noise; an INCOMPLETE one alerts on its own from inside the engine, which is the case worth hearing about. Keeps the newest app_settings.backup.keep_daily folders and deletes the rest. The .env file is never included — it holds the API keys."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 18 * * 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sunday 18:00 ET",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        120
      ],
      "notes": "After the Sunday weekly review (workflow 07, 09:00) and its backtest queue (workflow 10, 11:00), so the scorecard reads a week that has finished being written."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/ops/acceptance",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "GET /ops/acceptance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "The plan §17 gate to real money, MEASURED: backtests recorded, consecutive weeks of paper operation, closed trades, autopsies, unacknowledged failures, the Guardian drill, the ledger reconciliation and the deploy/stop latencies. Sends the plain-language summary to Telegram every Sunday so four weeks cannot pass on the strength of remembering that it 'mostly worked'. It grants nothing: live trading stays refused in app/broker/orders.assert_paper_only until a separate, owner-approved commit lifts it."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/ops/drill",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "false"
            },
            {
              "name": "store",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0011-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "POST /ops/drill",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Forces each of the ten Guardian checks to block, once, with fabricated inputs — no order is submitted and no setting is flipped. Runs AFTER the scorecard so Sunday's report describes last week's drill and this one lands in time for next week's. A check that has never blocked anything is a check nobody has evidence for; a drill that comes back incomplete alerts by itself."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every night 23:30 ET": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /ops/backup",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Sunday 18:00 ET": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "GET /ops/acceptance",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "GET /ops/acceptance": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /ops/drill",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/New_York",
    "errorWorkflow": ""
  },
  "active": false,
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "phase-8"
    }
  ]
}
